{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the swarm in space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against endless enemies while piloting your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and grow stronger each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.poster.avif?t=1761266021\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.webm?t=1761266021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.mp4?t=1761266021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your module loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless module combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different with roguelike upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.poster.avif?t=1761266021\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.webm?t=1761266021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.mp4?t=1761266021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend and grow even stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prisms when you ascend based on your highest cleared sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them to unlock permanent upgrades in the ascension tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.poster.avif?t=1761266021\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.webm?t=1761266021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.mp4?t=1761266021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Defeat swarming enemies to collect resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Unlock and combine modules for unique builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Face harder waves as you push through sectors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Ascend to reset your run and spend prisms on permanent upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Fast-paced incremental progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Roguelike module combinations for endless variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Permanent ascension tree upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Minimalist neon vector visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Short but replayable experience</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964430?t=1761266021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/02404c5bb20a8185a9fe40be3a8662df6e2b5796/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761266021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/9d7d100e437d9e78f715a2328ddf0e92b7b5d716/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761266021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.ak